s:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tunai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tipe Pesanan: Makan di tempat; No Meja: 5</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="n"><Data ss:Type="Number">56000</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="n"><Data ss:Type="Number">100000</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="n"><Data ss:Type="Number">44000</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CG20261018-002</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2026-10-18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15:20:00</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laundry &amp; Dry Cleaning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laundry Bersih</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sari</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Rina</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">085212345678</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Cuci Setrika</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="n"><Data ss:Type="Number">3.5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">kg</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="n"><Data ss:Type="Number">8000</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="n"><Data ss:Type="Number">2000</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="n"><Data ss:Type="Number">26000</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">pakaian</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">QRIS</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Layanan: Express</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="n"><Data ss:Type="Number">26000</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="n"><Data ss:Type="Number">26000</Data></Cell><Cell ss:StyleID="n"><Data ss:Type="Number">0</Data></Cell></Row></Table><WorksheetOptions xmlns="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:excel"><FreezePanes/><FrozenNoSplit/><SplitHorizontal>1</SplitHorizontal><TopRowBottomPane>1</TopRowBottomPane><ActivePane>2</ActivePane></WorksheetOptions></Worksheet>
<Worksheet ss:Name="Petunjuk Format"><Table><Column ss:Width="240"/><Column ss:Width="330"/><Row><Cell ss:StyleID="t"><Data ss:Type="String">PETUNJUK FORMAT IMPORT / EXPORT CASH GO</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. Sheet &quot;Penjualan&quot; adalah data yang dibaca aplikasi. Jangan mengubah / menghapus baris judul (baris 1).</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2. Satu baris = satu item. Transaksi dengan banyak item ditulis di banyak baris dengan No Transaksi yang SAMA.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3. Kolom wajib: No Transaksi, Tanggal, Nama Item, Qty, Harga Satuan. Kolom lain boleh kosong.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4. Tanggal ditulis YYYY-MM-DD (contoh 2026-10-18) atau DD/MM/YYYY. Jam ditulis HH:MM:SS.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5. Angka ditulis tanpa titik / simbol Rp (contoh 20000). Qty boleh desimal (contoh 1,5).</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6. Metode Bayar: Tunai, QRIS, Transfer, Debit, atau Lainnya.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7. Info Tambahan: pasangan &quot;Label: Isi&quot; dipisah titik koma, contoh &quot;Plat Nomor: DB 1234 AB; Jenis Kendaraan: Motor&quot;.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8. Total, Subtotal, dan Kembalian dihitung ulang oleh aplikasi saat import; yang dipakai adalah Qty x Harga - Diskon.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9. Transaksi dengan No Transaksi yang sudah ada di aplikasi akan dilewati (tidak ditimpa).</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10. Saat menyimpan dari Excel pilih tipe &quot;XML Spreadsheet 2003 (*.xml)&quot; atau &quot;CSV&quot;. Format &quot;.xls Excel 97-2003 (biner)&quot; tidak bisa dibaca aplikasi.</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kolom</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contoh isi</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No Transaksi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CG20261018-001</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tanggal</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2026-10-18</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Jam</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14:03:00</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bidang Usaha</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Warung Makan &amp; Restoran</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nama Usaha</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Warung Bu Ani</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kasir</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Andi</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nama Customer</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Budi</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No HP</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">081234567890</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nama Item</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nasi Goreng</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Qty</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Satuan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">porsi</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Harga Satuan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20000</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Diskon Item (Rp)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">0</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Subtotal (Rp)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40000</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keterangan Item</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">pedas</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Metode Bayar</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tunai</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Catatan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Info Tambahan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tipe Pesanan: Makan di tempat; No Meja: 5</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Total Transaksi (Rp)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56000</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dibayar (Rp)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">100000</Data></Cell></Row><Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kembalian (Rp)</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44000</Data></Cell></Row></Table></Worksheet>
